{"id":"n58767-1-9","stage":3,"title":"배낭 · 背包","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58767-1-9-1","ko":"민준아, 아침부터 배낭을 메고 어디에 가니?","zh":"敏俊啊，一大早就背着背包要去哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"아침부터","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침부터","audio":"/audio/27684d1037b9a47f708d.mp3"}},{"text":"배낭을","meaning":"背包","explanation":"배낭：背包；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배낭","audio":"/audio/031f289e467edc42f7cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58767","senseId":"1","lemma":"배낭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배낭을","audio":"/audio/4cb7bfbc4d3f09ca892c.mp3"}},{"text":"메고","meaning":"背，扛","explanation":"메다：背，扛；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"메다","audio":"/audio/7df1a991b810512557dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62085","senseId":"1","lemma":"메다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메고","audio":"/audio/dedb289d2afbdcdd6d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"가니?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가니","audio":"/audio/14b07c6dd4e5194ab610.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"031f289e467edc42","term":"배낭","zh":"背包","audio":"/audio/031f289e467edc42f7cf.mp3","entryId":"58767","definition":"可以放入东西背在背上的包。","pronunciation":["배ː낭"]},{"id":"7df1a991b8105125","term":"메다","zh":"背，扛","audio":"/audio/7df1a991b810512557dd.mp3","entryId":"62085","definition":"把物体放在肩膀或背上。","pronunciation":["메ː다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6d07b8f2689c6d8bed0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58767-1-9-2","ko":"친구들이랑 지리산을 등산하기로 했어요.","zh":"我和朋友们约好一起去智异山爬山呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구들이랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들이랑","audio":"/audio/6a4db7b9fcaec26aa7de.mp3"}},{"text":"지리산을","meaning":"智异山","explanation":"지리산：智异山；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지리산을","audio":"/audio/604e5155e3e53c1b9b0e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지리산을","audio":"/audio/604e5155e3e53c1b9b0e.mp3"}},{"text":"등산하기로","meaning":"登山","explanation":"등산하다：登山；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"등산하다","audio":"/audio/fd492ca360043783bdf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48802","senseId":"1","lemma":"등산하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등산하기로","audio":"/audio/d1ede2a0575631d7761e.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"fd492ca360043783","term":"등산하다","zh":"登山","audio":"/audio/fd492ca360043783bdf1.mp3","entryId":"48802","definition":"以运动或玩乐为目的爬山。","pronunciation":["등산하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/de5bd7c8d34cfdbb0164.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58767","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我和朋友们约好一起去智异山爬山呢。","敏俊啊，一大早就背着背包要去哪儿啊？","实验都做完了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊啊，一大早就背着背包要去哪儿啊？","实验都做完了吗？","我和朋友们约好一起去智异山爬山呢。"],"answer":2}]}
